WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.890
Doctor.

2
00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:01.850
Captain.

3
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:02.940
King.

4
00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:07.030
A title tells you who someone
is, and what they are for.

5
00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:09.650
Jesus' first followers were Jews.

6
00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.920
They gave him titles taken
from the Jewish scriptures.

7
00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:17.610
One title stuck so firmly that many
people now think it is his surname.

8
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:21.380
So what were his followers claiming
when they called him Christ?

9
00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:24.180
In this mission, you'll decode his titles,

10
00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:26.740
some from Hebrew and some from Greek.

11
00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:30.040
Then you'll find out what
Christians mean by Son of God,

12
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.150
and why Jesus called himself Son of Man.

13
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.560
Your mission: find out what his followers
were claiming when they called Jesus

14
00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:38.530
the Christ.
